; MaxAgent mzp control file (drag-and-drop manifest)
;
; Reference (Autodesk official, MAXDEV 2027 ENU):
;   "Drag-and-drop MAXScript Zip files" + "Zip-file Script Packages"
;   https://help.autodesk.com/view/MAXDEV/2027/ENU/?guid=GUID-35559C6A-CC75-4C8D-9A2A-8DFA73F2501E
;
; Protocol summary:
;   * mzp.run is NOT an INI file. It is a SEQUENCE OF COMMANDS.
;   * On drag-and-drop into 3ds Max:
;       - 'copy' / 'move' commands run.
;       - The first 'drop' command names the dropScript that will execute.
;       - 'run' / 'open' / 'import' / 'merge' / 'xref' commands are IGNORED
;         in drop context. Therefore we MUST use 'drop', not 'run'.
;   * dropScripts in 3ds Max are .ms files (the Autodesk doc says ".ds" but
;     this is a documentation error — Max actually accepts .ms with a
;     standard top-level fileIn execution model).
;   * '$max' is a special prefix for the 3ds Max install root. Relative
;     paths (no drive letter) are resolved against the system temp dir.
;
; What this manifest does:
;   1. name / version / description — package metadata.
;   2. extract to "maxagent_install" — extract every file in this mzp into
;      %TEMP%\maxagent_install\ (relative path → resolved against $temp).
;      This gives mzp_install.ms a STABLE, KNOWN root to find sibling files
;      (runtime\cpXX\, macros\, shared\), removing the dependency on
;      installerSource / getSourceFileName() which proved unreliable on
;      3ds Max 2022 CHS in field testing.
;   3. drop "mzp_install.ms" — when the user drops the mzp into a Max
;      viewport, this is the ONE script Max will execute. Inside that
;      script we do everything in a single linear flow:
;        copy runtime → install dir, register macros, register menu,
;        finally show the AI panel.
;   4. clear temp on MAX exit — auto-clean %TEMP%\maxagent_install\ when
;      Max exits, so we don't leave junk behind. (We CANNOT use plain
;      'clear temp' because that would delete the staging dir as soon as
;      drop finishes, and our install logic relies on it being present
;      during execution.)

name "MaxAgent"
version 1
description "MaxAgent — embedded AI assistant for 3ds Max"

extract to "maxagent_install"
drop "mzp_install.ms"
clear temp on MAX exit
